        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Pet Oddities: Desktop Shelter&quot;, you’ll use an ancient book to collect all kinds of cute, weird, funny, and uniquely styled creatures — until you find the oldest one and become the ultimate keeper!The game will keep getting updates! Yep, seriously — we’ll be updating it regularly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/a83f220e2f4bd092daa7560e3f739906.avif?t=1762904616\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all sorts of ancient creatures — and don’t worry, we’ll be adding even more in future updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/d38676be12926160d60004c413dbe3d6.avif?t=1762904616\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These creatures can even produce unexpected and ancient treasures… which might sell for a pretty good price! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/d38676be12926160d60004c413dbe3d6.avif?t=1762904616\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zooming and hiding options make the gameplay more fun and flexible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/122558f9e20ad57452fec668f601d2ce.avif?t=1762904616\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items and creatures you collect will be shown in your collection gallery — giving you that awesome feeling of progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Pet Oddities: Desktop Shelter&quot;, you’ll use an ancient book to collect all kinds of cute, weird, funny, and uniquely styled creatures — until you find the oldest one and become the ultimate keeper!The game will keep getting updates! Yep, seriously — we’ll be updating it regularly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/a83f220e2f4bd092daa7560e3f739906.avif?t=1762904616\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all sorts of ancient creatures — and don’t worry, we’ll be adding even more in future updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/d38676be12926160d60004c413dbe3d6.avif?t=1762904616\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These creatures can even produce unexpected and ancient treasures… which might sell for a pretty good price! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/d38676be12926160d60004c413dbe3d6.avif?t=1762904616\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zooming and hiding options make the gameplay more fun and flexible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/122558f9e20ad57452fec668f601d2ce.avif?t=1762904616\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\